{"parentUuid":"61981efd-a126-4f7d-9ccd-44c1b87b6e6d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgZiBrrA5TRXotbNqSmzG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't drive the window anymore. Its capture comes back blank, so the display may be asleep, locked, or covered. I'll stop here rather than keep forcing it.\n\n**A4 exit status:**\n- **Line comments: done.** Comments on `calc.py:5` and `test_calc.py:3` went back verbatim. Each next diff answered them. Now the docstring is in, `test_add` is kept, both `divide` tests are added, and nothing is uncommitted.\n- **Approve and land: open.** Two Approve clicks missed. The first landed on a diff line after the window moved to a display with a different scale, and the second hit after the window left the screen. `divide` still waits at Review, and `demo-b` main is unchanged.\n- **Hold: not checked live.** A hold takes 30 minutes to run out. The core tests and the loop test cover it.\n\n**To finish:** open `divide` in Bastion and press **Approve**. The note box shows a stray `test_calc.py:3:` from my missed click; Approve ignores it. Then tell me, and I'll check the land in `demo-b`, record it in the plan, and close A4.\n\n**One more thing to check:** the job page still showed the review artifact from 15 minutes earlier, not the newest one. Pushes may not reach the page while the window is hidden. I'll look into it after the land."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3097,"cache_read_input_tokens":889377,"output_tokens":571,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":135},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3097,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":571,"cache_read_input_tokens":889377,"cache_cre