{"parentUuid":"8fa4df0a-ba14-4d1c-99b9-30370a509dc1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9da252d5-7bdd-4bfb-9765-67179370fab1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B9yE1xnTRZtVYj1854NoBb","type":"tool_result","content":"(Bash completed with no output)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"05ef66ac-f254-42b1-b83e-387e746bb545","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:03:21.808Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"552d2b12-a8cd-4517-af45-9987b8e7fc67","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","root":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8fa4df0a-ba14-4d1c-99b9-30370a509dc1","session_id":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"05ef66ac-f254-42b1-b83e-387e746bb545","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgZjHMqwJ2AumZ5uWjwFC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the CI failure locally. Every CI step now passes on 1.97: format, both clippy runs, all 54 tests, and the seam check. The push is still running, so I haven't confirmed a green CI run yet.\n\n**Why CI was red:** clippy failed on three lints that are new in Rust 1.97. CI uses 1.97, as pinned in `rust-toolchain.toml`.\n- `useless_borrows_in_formatting` in `n7_roundtrip.rs:129`. This has failed every CI run since spike N7 landed.\n- A nested `if` that the lint wants merged into its `match` arm, in `factory.rs`.\n- `sort_by` that should be `sort_by_key`, in the fake store.\n\n**Why I didn't catch it:** your global mise config (`~/.config/mise/config.toml`) pins `rust 1.92.0` and sets `RUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN`, so every local cargo run used 1.92 and ignored the repo's pin. From now on I'll run checks with `cargo +1.97.0`. To fix it for good, you could add a `mise.toml` in the repo with `rust = \"1.97.0\"`, or drop the global pin. Both are your call.\n\n**Also in this push:** the restored `PLAN.md`. My governance rewrite in `c963b33` kept only the lines up to the D19 row, which deleted §4–§12: the phases, the parity map, the risks, and the progress table. I rebuilt those sections from the earlier version plus that commit's own edits. The plan has every section again, with A4 recorded as done and A5 next."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":454,"cache_read_input_tokens":828511,"output_tokens":530,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":454,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":530,"cache_read_input_tokens":828511,"cache_creation_input_tokens":454,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":454},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"261748cc-8e00-458c-830c-85dfc52a70ae","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgZjHMTsHMmG3FENjpdYK","type":"assistant","uuid":"c70475c3-aac4-438e-9110-8b3b09627397","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:03:32.957Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main"}
